# Water and Grass starter decks

Two additional Modern practice starters, each with 15 Pokémon, 31 Trainers and 14 Basic Energy: 60 cards total. Each includes exactly one Legendary copy and a complete 4–3–3 featured evolution line. These additions raised the roster to 19, with the preceding 17 lists unchanged. The source roster is now 21 following [Dragon's Ascent](dragon-ascent-deck.md) and [Axe Forge](axe-forge-deck.md).

These use active, implemented cards from the game's supported pool. They are practice decks, not official Standard-rotation lists.

## Shell Surge — Water

ID: `showdown-shell`. Evolve Squirtle into Blastoise and prepare Hydro Pump with Water Energy. Vitality Spring searches for up to six Energy and attaches them, but **ends your turn**; finish other actions before using it. Frosmoth's Ice Dance attaches Water Energy from hand to Benched Water Pokémon, so switching helps prepare an attacker. Suicune's Crystal Fall reaches 120 damage when at least four Water Energy are in play.

